<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Synthetic Document</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial;
        }
        .header-title {
            font-size: 48pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #333;
        }
        .section-heading {
            font-size: 36pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .sub-heading {
            font-size: 24pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .body-text {
            font-size: 14pt;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .list-item {
            font-size: 14pt;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .footer-text {
            font-size: 10pt;
            text-align: right;
        }
        .red-text {
            color: #A52A2A; /* Approximating the deep red/maroon */
        }
    </style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; height: 100%;">
        <div style="flex: 1; background-image: url('placeholder_image_1.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;">
            <!-- Image placeholder for visual layout mirroring -->
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1; padding-left: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;">
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <h1 class="header-title" style="color: white; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000;">DISCOVER YOUR</h1>
                <h1 class="header-title" style="color: white; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000;">ACADEMIC</h1>
                <h1 class="header-title" style="color: white; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000;">SUCCESS</h1>
                <h1 class="header-title" style="color: white; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000;">AT KU</h1>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: auto; text-align: right;">
                <p class="footer-text">R. Chad Brown, Ed. D.</p>
                <p class="footer-text">Assistant Director For Retention & Student Success</p>
                <p class="footer-text">KUTZTOWN UNIVERSITY | {{ date_of_document }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="text-align: center;">WHAT IS SUCCESS?</h2>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
        <p class="body-text" style="max-width: 80%;">Success is staying on course to your desired outcomes and experiences, creating wisdom, happiness, and unconditional self-worth along the way.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 80px;">
        <!-- Logo placeholder -->
        <span data-field="university.logo">{{ university.logo }}</span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="text-align: center;">What are some of the challenges associated with attending college</h2>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
        <!-- Image placeholder for visual layout mirroring -->
        <div style="width: 100%; height: 400px; background-image: url('placeholder_image_3.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"></div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 class="section-heading">STUDENT RESPONSIBILITY</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
        <li class="list-item">Successful students attend all classes</li>
        <li class="list-item">Successful students possess library and internet research skills.</li>
        <li class="list-item">Need to budget funds for textbooks and other essentials throughout the semester</li>
    </ul>
    <div style="margin-top: 60px; text-align: center;">
        <!-- Logo placeholder -->
        <span data-field="university.logo">{{ university.logo }}</span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 class="section-heading">TIME MANAGEMENT</h2>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div style="flex: 1; padding-right: 30px;">
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
                <li class="list-item">You manage your own time</li>
                <li class="list-item">You must decide whether to participate in extracurricular activities</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center;">
            <!-- Image placeholder for visual layout mirroring -->
            <div style="width: 100%; height: 250px; background-image: url('placeholder_image_5.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 40px; text-align: center;">
        <p class="body-text" style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">YOU BALANCE RESPONSIBILITIES AND SET PRIORITIES ON YOUR OWN</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 class="section-heading">WHAT IS TIME MANAGEMENT?</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
        <li class="list-item">the ability to use one's time effectively &amp; productively.</li>
        <li class="list-item">Creating an environment conducive to effectiveness</li>
        <li class="list-item">Setting of priorities</li>
        <li class="list-item">Carrying out activity around those priorities</li>
        <li class="list-item">The related process of reduction of time spent on non-priorities</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 class="section-heading">STUDY HOURS</h2>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
        <div style="flex: 1; padding-right: 30px;">
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
                <li class="list-item">You will spend 12 to 16 hours each week in class</li>
                <li class="list-item">You will need to study at least 2 to 3 hours outside of class for each hour of class</li>
                <li class="list-item">You will be assigned reading and writing which may not be directly addressed in class</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center;">
            <!-- Image placeholder for visual layout mirroring -->
            <div style="width: 100%; height: 250px; background-image: url('placeholder_image_6.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 class="section-heading">DISTRACTIONS......</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
        <li class="list-item">Familiar Environments: (your room, house, apartment) Use a space that promotes study such as the library</li>
        <li class="list-item">Movies/ TV: Use these as rewards for accomplishing your study goals</li>
        <li class="list-item">Exercise and Hobbies: Look at the expectations of your education and schedule around them</li>
        <li class="list-item">Friends, Associates, Family: Share with them the importance of your education and find a balance</li>
        <li class="list-item">Internet: Set and adhere to a limited time</li>
        <li class="list-item">Study Buddies: Set goals for each study session</li>
    </ul>
</div>



<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_1.png" alt="Student Success Mascot" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
      <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <p style="font-style: italic; font-size: 1.1em;">"Student Success helped me with test anxiety and how to relax before, during and after a test. Additionally, they helped me with time management and how to space out my work and studying comfortably."</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 10px;">- <span data-field="student_name">{{ student_name }}</span>, <span data-field="student_major">{{ student_major }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 2.5em; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;">STUDENT SUCCESS</h1>
      
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">PERSONALIZED ACADEMIC SUPPORT</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">Professionals and Graduate Assistants provide personalized academic skills counseling through individual meetings and group presentations.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">STUDENT SUCCESS WORKSHOPS</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">Workshops are offered both in-person and online to help students be successful both academic and personally. Topics include time management, learning styles, test anxiety and many more.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">CONNECT STUDENTS WITH CAMPUS RESOURCES</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">Connect students with resources to support both academic and personal success</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">FIRST YEAR SEMINAR SUPPORT</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">Compliment the FYS Seminar by providing in-class presentations</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_2.png" alt="Students Studying" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 2.5em; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 30px;">TUTORING SERVICES</h1>
      
      <div style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">1. PEER TUTORING</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">Free service for undergraduate students having difficulty in their <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> courses. Tutors are available for most 100-200 level courses as well as some upper level courses.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">2. SUPPLEMENTAL INSTRUCTION (SI)</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">Type of academic assistance that targets traditionally difficult academic courses by providing regularly scheduled, out-of-class, peer-facilitated sessions.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">3. TUTORING LABS</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">Drop-in group tutoring in select Business, Computer Science, Math, and STEM courses.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">4. FIRST YEAR SEMINAR SI</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">Helps first-year students to explore factors involving adjusting to college life, campus opportunity and involvement, campus resources, and career exploration. Outside of the classroom, FYS SI's lead students through the welcome week experience and help new students during their first semester at <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">5. ACADEMIC PEER MENTORS</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">A knowledgeable student who has a general understanding of <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> processes, academics, and resources that can enhance a student's academic experience.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_3.png" alt="Student Success Mascot on Sign" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 30px;">
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center;">
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; background-color: #e74c3c; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 1.2em;">?</div>
            <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; background-color: #f39c12; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 1.2em;">?</div>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; background-color: #3498db; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 1.2em;">?</div>
            <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; background-color: #2ecc71; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 1.2em;">?</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div style="margin-top: auto;">
        <p style="font-size: 1.1em; line-height: 1.5;">Rohrbach Library, Room <span data-field="room_number">{{ room_number }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">Kutztown University</p>
        <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">Phone: (<span data-field="phone_area_code">{{ phone_area_code }}</span>) <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">Email: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5;">Web: <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>